Make sure the page can reach LightDM.

The greeter object (__LightDMGreeter) reaches the theme only through the web
extension, which WebKit loads into each web process.  A page whose web
process came up without it still shows the theme, but nobody can sign in
from it and the power menu stays empty -- and nothing said why.

  - The extension notes in the greeter log when it has connected to
    LightDM (or why not) and when it has put the greeter object on the
    page.
  - Once the page has loaded, the greeter looks for the object; a page
    without it is given a new web process (the extension is loaded again
    with it), twice at most, and the log says what happened.

